"Natalie Choir is an S-rank Rabbit from South Carolina with the skill Cook of the Moment."
"She is tall and blonde, with gold eyes, one dimple and a radio-host voice with a mild drawl."
"She lives in room 914 of the Warren intake tower, across the hall from Alden Thorn."
"She wants to max her skill and become the universe's best personal chef."
"She plans to attend the School for the Arts at Celena North High."
"Her roommates guard her from admirers and adopted Alden as an honorary roommate."
"Alden hired her to cook all his meals for weeks, at about fifty Argold a plate."
"She put all her extra enhancement points into Appeal."
"Her meal containers carry motivational quotes and nutrition labels."
"She was accepted to the CNH Arts program, where she will study molecular gastronomy."
"She is apartment hunting in Apex to live with Hadiza and Emilija, bribing landlords with cake."
"By November she lives with Hadiza and Emilija near Boom Town, in a flat with a pizza oven."
"She has begun practicing cooking meat."
"At the Bunker Street riot in the Matadero flood, a guard grabbed her as bait."
